# K03 NS-ROLES-VIS (the author, 2026-10-07; semantics #declaration-visibility): a definition below makes no
# head above it known; the first written occurrence of an unknown head defines it, whatever its tail.
# `Later(3)` defines Later with 3; the block `Later:` below is then Later's application with a body -- an ordinary
# named Structure takes no argument: refused at the block.
Later(3)
Later:
    int: v 1
end: Later
fn: m () int
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
